  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-27T11:45:21.007Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Allow users to write Udon for their local client to use, that is either tied to an avatar or their own local client.\nIf tied to an avatar, allow the Udon to be shared this way, but with security features built in so that a user has to consent to enable the Udon with a warning first.\nThis Udon should be containered and have only limited abilities to interface with the client data. For example, it should not be possible to make a client Udon script that teleports the user around, or listen into conversations they should not be able to hear.\n\nUses of this feature could include:\n1. Accessibility features\n2. Nice-to-haves like personal mirrors, clocks, notifications/reminders.\n3. Interactions with external programs via OSC (i.e. bringing the eventual 'world OSC' feature to this Udon variant).",
